# debug artifacts that lasm and its stages write to the current directory.
# *.out used to be ignored wholesale, which would have swallowed the golden
# files in pkg/ml1/testdata, so these are named instead. The list is checked
# against the source by TestDebugArtifactsAreDeclared, which is also what says
# a library call must not produce any of them.
asm_listing.txt
asm_symtab.txt
ast_listing.txt
scanner_buffer.txt
scanner_tokens.txt
vm_stdmsg.txt
vm_stdout.txt
